<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MIC" style="id">Micah</book>
  <para style="h">Micah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Micah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Micah</para>
  <para style="mt">Micah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah gam kumpite ahi Jotham, Ahaz, Hezekiah-te’ hun laitahin Moresheth mi Micah tungah Topa thu tung a, Samaria le Jerusalem tawh kisai a mangmuna tam bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />No mipi zosiete aw, za un; leitung le a sunga teng zosie aw, ngai un; Topa Pasien in a biehinn siengtho panin note langkhatah teci pang taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen en un, a tenna mun panin Topa ang pei ding a, ama in leitung mun sangte tuoncilin ang kumsuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin mei gei-a khuoinun zung bang le, kentawng pana tui kisung bangin, a keng nei-ah muolte zungmangin kuomte a pawhkeh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tam thu zosie Jacob’ khielna le Israel innkuonte’ mawna zieh ahi hi. Jacob’ khielna bang ahiei? Samaria hi lo amah? Judah munsang bang ahei? Jerusalem hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin keima in Samaria khuopi, gamlah buathah kholna suohsahin, lenggui ciinna mun ka suohsah ding hi. Kuom sungah ama’ suongte ka sungsuh ding a, khuombulte ka laidawh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A milimte zosie kisatguoi ding a, a thaman zosie zong mei tawh kihal ding hi. Tuale keima in a milimte zosie ka susie ding hi; ama in numei pahtatte’ thamante a khop ziehin, numei pahtatte’ thaman ding ma-in tuate kizangkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam thu ziehin kapin ka mau ding hi. Puonsil loin ka kengguohin lam ka pei ding hi; si-alte bangin ka ham ding a, va-kalaohte bangin ka tau ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen a kidamsah thei lo ama’ liemma in Judah gam dong law hi; tuami in Jerusalem khuo-a ka mite’ tunkot tung zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gath ah tua thu gen sih unlen, zong kap sih un; Beth-leaphrah khuo sunga leivui lahah kilawmlia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Shaphir-a teng mite aw, guohtang le maizumin na lampi vuah peisuoh un. Zaanan-a a teng mite aw, pusuoh sih un; Beth-ezel kapin mau-in om a, na kung panun a kihuna kilakhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen Maroth-a teng mite in sil hoi ang tun ding kal a ngahla mama vua, ahi vangin Topa kung panin Jerusalem tunkot ah gimna a peisuh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lachish-a teng mite aw, sakolte a leeng ah bul un; note pen Zion tanute’ mawna kipatna na hi uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile note sungah Israel’ khielna kimu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ziehin Moreseth-gath tungah mangpha paina letsong na pie ding uhi; Israel kumpite adingin Achzip innkuonte pen kisolna ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mareshah-a teng mite aw, note tungah guolzo pa khat kang puohkia ding hi; Adullam khuo ah Israel’ minthanna a tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na kipahpi uh na tate adingin na sam heu unlen, na lu kieusah un; langta bangin na lu kieusah un, bangzieh ahei cile na kung panun amate suoh le salin kikai zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gitlona le gamtat hoilo a gelte in gimna a thuoh ding uhi! Zingmawng khuo vah ciengin amate in a bawl pai uhi, bangzieh ahei cile amate in bawl theina thu a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lo a deigaw uleh tuate a matpieh vazieu uhi; inn a deigaw ule tuate a lahpieh vazieu uhi; amate in innsuongpa le innte, mite le a goute a bawlsie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Tu-in tam innkuon tungah sietna tunsah ka sawm a, note in khum panin na ngawng uh na pongsah zo sih ding uhi; tua khu hun sie ahi ziehin, na kiphatsah pei nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin amate in note ang tawhna uh la khat sa-in, a hlasiet huoi kaala tawh amate a kap ding vua, “Eite i kisie dihdeh uhi; Topa in ka mite’ gouluo ei khelpieh hi; tua khu ka kung panin bang a ci lahdawh adiei! Sala ei mante tungah i logamte hawm sieng ta,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa’ mite kikhopna ah aisanin khau tawh a te ding koima na nei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Thu hil sih un,” ci-in tam bangin thu hil uhi. “Mi khat in tam bang thute gen dingin kilawm lo hi; mindaina in ei nuaphah zo sih va,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jacob innkuonte aw, Topa’ thuohzawhna a tawp sieng ta amah? Tamte ama bawl ma amah? ci-in tam thute kigen ding amah? Thuman taha gamtate tungah ka kammalte in na hoi bawl hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka mite, gal banga do dingin na kuonto uhi; lungmuonga a omte, a puontuol hawhin, gal thu ngaisuta zong a nei lo lungmuonga a peite kung panin, a puontuolte uh na sut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amau’ innnuom panin ka mite’ numeite na notmang uhi; a tasente uh tung panin kumtawnin ka minthanna na lamang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tho unlen pei un; kisietna a nasie mama tawh a susie sientho lona om ahi ziehin, tam mun tawlngahna ding mun hi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zuouthu hawmpi genin mi khat pei kawikawi a, keima in “Lenggazu le khamtheizu thu kang hil ding hi,” ci-in thu ang gen leh, tua bang mipa pen tam mite adingin a thuhil pa uh ahi ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jacob aw, na unpi-un kang kaikhawm valon ding hi, Israel a omlai teng zong kang kaikhawm ding hi; tuubuh sunga tuu khum bang le lonona muna tuuhon bangin amate ka koiton ding hi; khum mun pen mi husa tawh a kidimkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A masang vuah a honpieh pa a pei ding hi; tunkot phukehin a kantan ding vua, tua tunkot panin a pusuoh ding uhi. A mai vuah a kumpipa uh a pei ding a, Topa pen amau’ lutang hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keima in tam bangin ka gen hi: No Jacob lutangte le Israel innkuon sunga a uhte aw, ngai vawi un! Note in thutang na thei ding uh kilawm hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />No, a hoi nate muda-in a hoi lo nate a dei mite, ka mite’ vun lempiehin, a gu tung vua tel le vo a kheupiehte aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />note in ka mite’ sa na ne vua, beela kihuon ding sa le khangbeela kikang ding sa bangin na semnen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa kungah a kiko vua, hizongle ama in a dawng sih ding hi; a siet gamtat ziehun, khum hun ciengin ama in a kung panun a maitang a phuol ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Neh ding themkhat a nei ciengun, “Lungmuon om” ci-in kiko-in, a kam sung vuah neh ding a koipieh lo mite tungah gal bawng ding thu a gen, ka mite lam a pielsah kamsangte tawh kisai-in, Topa in tam bangin gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin note tungah mangmuna om loin zan ang tung ding a, note tungah kihilna om loin khuomiel ang tung ding hi. Kamsangte tungah ni tum ding a, amate tungah sun zong a miel ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />thumute a muolpho ding vua, aisante maizum ding uhi; Pasien tung panin dawnna a op lo ziehin, amate in a unpi-un a kam a hum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin kei ka hileh, Jacob’ khielna le Israel’ mawna a pulah dingin, vanglietna, Topa’ hlagau, thutang le hatna tawh ka kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />No Jacob innkuon a uhte, thutang huo-in thuman a leheite aw, tam thu khu za un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sisan luonsahna tawh Zion na lam vua, khielna tawh Jerusalem na lam uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A khuopi uh a uhte in guhgol tawh thukhenin, thaman nga nadingin a siempute in thu a hil vua, a kamsangte in sum nga nadingin thuphuon a gen uhi; hinanle Topa tungah a kingam bangin a om vua, “A tahtahin eite tawh Topa ang om hi! Eite tungah gimna kici hing tung sih va,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua hi a, note ziehin lo bangin Zion kihlo ding hi; Jerusalem, buathah kholna suoh ding a, biehinn muol, gammang suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ang tung ding hunah Topa’ biehinn opna muol pen muolte lahah a sangpenin kikoi ding a, muoltangte tungah kisangkhan ding hi. Khum munah mite a pei ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />minam tampite zong ang pei in: “Hing pei un, ama in a lampi ei hilin, a lampite i zui thei nadingin, Topa’ muol tung, Jacob Pasien’ biehinn ah va kato va vui,” a ci ding uhi. Azieh pen Zion panin thuhilna ang pei ding a, Jerusalem panin Topa’ kammal ang pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in mi tampite kikalah thu khen ding a, gamlapi-a om minam thahatte kikal kihaunate vengsah ding hi; a namsaute uh lo kaina tuzumin a kheng ding vua, a teipite uh singba heuna namkawi-in a kheng ding uhi; minam khatlekhat kidona-in namsau lam nawn loin, gal simdan ding zong a sin nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin a lenggui hlim nei ule a theikung hlimte uh nei-ah a unpi-un a to ziuzieu ding vua, koima in a zausah sih ding hi; azieh pen Vanglien Topa Pasien in a kam tawh a na gensa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen minam zosie amau’ pasien min ciet tawh a kalsuon uhi, eite i hi leh a tawntungin Topa i Pasien’ minin i kalsuon zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin keima in khelbaite ka khawm ding a, a kidelmang mite le ka bawlsiet mite ka kaikhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khelbaite, a omlai minamin ka bawl ding a, a kidelmang mite, a thakhau minam khatin ka bawl ding hi; tuale Zion Muola amate tungah tu le a tawntungin Topa a maang den ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuuhon cinna tausang, Zion’ tanu opna muol aw, nangma tungah ang tung ding hi. Nangma kungah nidanga kumpi thuneina ang tung ding a, Jerusalem tanu’ kumpi gam ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bang dinga kap vapuoh na hei? Na sungah kumpi om lo amah? Na thu kuppi pa mangthai-in, nausuoh natna in a tut numei bangin natna in ang tun ta amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem tanu aw, numei nausuoh bangin kipeh inlen tau in; azieh pen khuopi panin nang na pusuoh ding a, gamlah ah giephuol satin Babylon khuopi lam na zuon ding hi; khum munah na suohta ding a, khum munah Topa in na galte khut sung panin ang tan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang ang sim dingin minam tampi a kikhawm vua, “Ama buasah vai-in, i mit-in Zion kaihlit vai,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in Topa’ ngaisutnate a thei sih uhi. Ancilna phuola bulomte a kikaikhop bangin kaikhop dinga a gel lam amate in a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zion tanu aw, tho-in cil in, azieh pen na ki sia-in ahi a, na kephang sumngo-in ahi zongin ka bawl ding hi; mi tampite tuoncilin, Topa tungah amau’ neisate na pie ding a, leitung buppi a uh Topa tungah amau’ hauna teng na pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in na kimvelah kul tawh ang ki-im hi; i langkhatah sim dingin ei kikuikhum hi; amate in ciengpum tawh Israel gam uhpa’ pheta a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bethlehem Ephrathah aw, Judah bete lahah a neu pen na hi vangin, nang sung panin Israel a uh ding mipa khat ang pieng ding a, ama ang kipatna pen tangtawng ni masa lai ahi tabo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tua nu in nausuo natna thuohin, a suo hun a tun masangsie, amate don loin koi phot ding hi; tua ciengin Israel mite kungah a unau omsun teng ang kilekia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa’ hatna le Topa a Pasien’ min thupi sungah ama ding ding a, a tuuhonte a vah ding hi. Tuale amate bihtahin a teng ding uhi, azieh pen leimong dongah ama mi thupi hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuale ama pen kilemna khat ahi ding hi. I gam sungah Assyria-te ang pei-in, i leitang ang tot uleh, amate do dingin tuucing sagi dingsahin, makai giet i koi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A namsau utawh Assyria gam a uh ding vua, namsau dawsa-in Nimrod’ gam a uh ding uhi; i gamah amate ang lutin i gamgi sung ang tot uleh, Assyria-te kung panin amate in eite ei hunkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin mi tampite in a imtawm, Jacob suon a omlai teng pen mihingte tunga kingam lo, mi koima tunga lametna a nei lo, Topa kung pana ang pei daitui le lopa tunga a kie guomal tawh a kibang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi tampi in a imtawm, minamte lahah a om Jacob suon a omlai teng pen gamlah gamsa lahah a om humpi tawh a kibang ding vua, tuuhonte lahah a om humpi khanglaite tawh a kibang ding uhi. Tuute a tuokhah ciengin tuoncilin ehmal a, a hun ding koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na kidopite tungah na khut na lamto ding a, na galte a unpi-un kisumaimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in a cina ah, khum ni ciengin na kung panin na sakolte sumaimangin, na sakol leengte ka susie ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />na gam sunga khuopite sumaimangin, na mun muonhuoi zosie uh ka phelmang ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />na khut panin mibum theite sumaimangin, aisan theite na nei nawn sih ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />note lah panin na milimte sumaimangin, na biehna songte uzong ka sumaimang ding a, khut tawh na bawlsa uh nate mai-ah na kun nawn sih ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />note lahah a om na khuom siengthote uh phungkalin, na khuopite uh ka susie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka thu a mang lo minamte tungah lungthahna le thangpaina tawh phu ka la ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa thu gen bang ahei ngai in: Dingin muolsangte mai-ah na thu sung inlen, na aw muoltangte zasah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />No muolsangte le a kip leitung bulpite aw, Topa in mi a nielna ngai vawi un; azieh pen a mite tawh Topa thu kiniel a, Israel-te tawh thu kisel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka mite aw, note bang kang law ahei? kang bangci lungkhamsah ahei? ei dawng vawi un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen Egypt gam panin kang peipi to a, saltanna inn panin kang tankhie hi; na mai vuah Moses, Aaron, le Miriam-te kang sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka mite aw, Moab Kumpipa Balak in bang teng na gel a, Beor’ tapa Balaam in bang na ci dawnkia-in, Topa’ hutdamna nasepte na thei nadingun, Shittim panin Gilgal dongah bang thu na pieng ahei, ci tu-in phawhkia un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“ Topa mai-ah bang tawh va pei-in, a sangpen Pasien mai-ah bang tawh va kun ding ka hei? Meihal biehnate le kumkhat a pha bawngno tawh a mai-ah va pei ding ka mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuutang tulkhat, gun tulsawm dim sathau tawh Topa lungkim ding amah? Ka tatkhielna ziehin ka tapa tapen le, ka hla’ mawna ga ziehin ka hinsa ka ta pie ding ka mah?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihing aw, ama in bang pen hoi ahei, ci ang genzo ta hi; tuale thu tanga khen ding le migit ding deigaw-in, kiniemkhiehin na Pasien tawh na zawton ding ci simlo nang tungah Topa in bang ang kalh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khuopi sungah Topa’ kiko a, (na min zatahna pen pilna tahtah ahi hi): Minam le khuopi sunga ang kikhawmte aw , za vawi un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Migilote’ inn sunga om gitlona tawh a kinga goute le a kisamsie tawitena themkhatte mangngil thei ding ka mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A gihna man lo tawikhainate le a tena a man lo ip a zangte ka mawh koi ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na mihaute uh tatsietna tawh kidim hi; na khuosung mite in zuouthu vive a gen vua, a kam sung vua a leite uzong zuouthu tawh a kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ziehin na mawnate ziehun hing sat gawpin, a hawmkieu- a kang opsah ding uh ka kipan ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An na neh mawh vangun na kham sih ding vua, na sung vuah na gil uh a kiel zing ding hi; khol zong nan locin na kemcing sih ding vua, na kepsunte uzong namsau tungah ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na tu mawh vangun na at sih ding uhi; Olive ga na cil mawh vangun, sathau na si sih ding uhi; lengga na cil mawh vangun, na dawnkha sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azieh pen Omri’ ngaina kip teng le Ahab innkuon’ gamtat zosie na kemcing vua, a thumop zosie na zui uhi. Tua ahi ziehin a hawmkieu-in hing koi-in, na sunga a teng mite’ ehneh ho-in ka bawl ding hi; tuaci’n ka mite’ kisimmawna na thuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gim ngapa hi tang e! Bangzieh ahei cile, khal lai-a singga a kilaw zaw le, lengga sangh a kikhop zaw ka bang ta a, ka neh ding lengga bawh ka mu ta sih hi; ka dugaw thei min masa zong a om ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gam sung panin mi citahte a mangthai ta vua, mi thuman koima a om nawn sih hi; sisan suo nadingin mi a buh kawikawi vua, khatlekhat lenthang a kisie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sie bawl ding pen a khut siem thei mama uhi; uliente le thukhente in guhgol a ngen vua, thuneite in amau’ dei teng a kigen vazieu uhi; tua ci bangin amate in thutang a lehei vazieu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihoi pena kineite ling tawh kibang a, thuman pena kineite daithaw-imna ling tawh kibang hi. Amau’ galvilte ni, amau’ dan thuoh ding ni, ang tung zo hi; tu-in amau’ buoizah hun ang nai mama ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na guolpa muong sinlen, na itte zong muong sin; na angkawi na zi tung panin na kam kotkhahte kemcing in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile tapa in a pa simmaw bawlin, tanu in a nu langpan a, a monu in a innpi nu a langpan hi; na innkuonpi teng ma na gal a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin kei ka hile Topa ka en ding a, ka hutdamna Pasien ka lamen lenlon ding hi; ka Pasien in kei ei za ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka galpa aw, kei tungah kipah sin; ka pua ciengin ka thokia lel ding hi; khuomiel ah ka to ciengin, Topa pen khuovah ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama tungah ka maw zo ziehin kei lamah ama hing pangin, ama in kei adingin thu a khen masangsie, Topa’ lungthahna ka thuoh kul ding hi. Ama in kei khuovah ah ei peipi ding hi; ama in dih ei tansahna ka mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka galte in mu-in, ka kungah, “Na Pasien hei-a om ahei?” ci-a ei dong nu maizumna in khucip ding hi. Ka mit in ama’ puana mu ding hi; lamdunga buonnawi a kitotcil bangin tu-in ama kituoncil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na kulbang a kicienkia ni ang tung ta hi! Khum ni ciengin gamgi kigolkeh mama ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin Assyria gam panin Egypt gam dong, Egypt gam panin Gunpi dong, tuipi khat pan tuipi khat dong, muolsang khat pan muolsang khat dongin, nangma kungah amate ang pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin a tunga teng mite le amau’ sepna ga ziehin, leitung gamkhing le gamdai suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na ciengkhut tawh na mite tuu bangin cing in, nangma-a’ ahi na tuuhonte, um lei laikim gamlahah a guohtangun teng uhi. Tanglai hun ma bangin Bashan le Gilead ah amate an maisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Egypt gam pan nang peito lai bangin, na lamdangte ko ei lah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Minamte in a mu ding vua, amau’ thahatna zosie a zumpi ding uhi; a kam sung vuah a khut uh koi-in, a bil uh a bing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gul bangin leivui a lieh ding vua, leitunga a bawhva teng tawh kibang ding uhi; a kulpite panun citun kawmin ang pusuoh ding uhi; a zau seng ziehun Topa i Pasien lam ang kihei ding vua, amate in note zong ang giing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangma’ neisa a omlai teng’ khielna maisahin, amau’ thupalsatnate a maisah thei nang bang Pasien a om amah? Hepina lah ding ama dei lam ahi ziehin, kumtawnin ama a lungthah zing sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in eite tungah lainatna ei neikia ding hi; i mawnate uzong a keng nei-ah tuoncil ding hi. Kote’ mawna zosie, tuipi thuh sungah na sepmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tangtawng panin ka pu ka pate tunga na ciem bangin, Jacob tungah thumanna le Abraham tungah a kip citahna na lah ding hi.
  </para>
</usx>
